\label{thm:TU_equivalence}
For a given TDG procedure $d$, suppose its incidence matrix $\mathbf{M}$ is totally unimodular almost surely. That is, every square submatrix of $\mathbf{M}$ has determinant in $\{-1,0,1\}$. Then

